// BUG-1017: an array index in the for-loop STEP was checked under the INIT range.
//
// `for (u32 k = 0; k < 8; k += a[k] + 1)` on a `u32[4]` proved `a[k]` against
// k in [0,0] — the value BEFORE the loop — marked the node proven for good, and
// emitted a bare `k += a[k] + 1;` with no bounds check, no auto-guard and NO
// warning. ASan: stack-buffer-overflow (reads a[4]..a[7]).
//
// This is BUG-1015 (the condition) at the one loop POSITION that fix missed.
//
// DISCRIMINATES: pre-fix the loop runs all 8 iterations (4 of them OOB reads)
// and returns 8. Post-fix the auto-guard fires the first time k reaches 4 and
// the function returns early — exit 0.
u32 main() {
    u32[4] a;
    u32 n = 0;
    for (u32 k = 0; k < 8; k += a[k] + 1) {
        n += 1;
    }
    return n;
}
